<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT CAMEROON 2-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT CAMEROON 2-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>CURITIBA, Brazil 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Cameroon</p>
<p>2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly soccer international on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Giovanni (14th minute), Djalminha (48th)</p>
<p>Attendance; 26,238</p>
</text>
